A minor update to fix some issues:

* Wrong sequence (autoincrement) on PostgreSQL databases
* Logo size on maintainance, compatibility and installation pages
* Unclear versions list during update

See [Galette 1.2.0.1 changelog]({{ site.galette.doc_url }}/{{ site.lang }}/develop/changelog.html#v1201) for all details.

